DESCRIPTION:
ICP-MS is a useful instrument that can be applied to solid- and solution-based samples. Applications include;

Laser ablation-inductively coupled plasma-mass spectrometry of solid samples for elemental composition. Samples include biological tissue, teeth, coral and fish otoliths.

ICP-MS can determine the majority of elements except for carbon, nitrogen, oxygen and the noble gases.

